---
// Exists so Cloudflare Pages answers unknown paths with a real 404 status.
// Without a 404.html in the build, Pages falls back to index.html with a 200,
// which is a soft 404: every wrong URL becomes an indexable copy of the tool.
//
// Visitors never see this page on novasanchez.com: the suite-router Worker
// swaps any 404 from a tool for the main site's 404 page, so the design lives
// in one place. It only shows up if someone opens the pages.dev host directly.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Página no encontrada</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Esta página no existe. <a href="https://novasanchez.com/">Ir a novasanchez.com</a></p>
  </body>
</html>
